---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Falo Chinês 🧭 - Licenças Open-Source" description="Licenças de software e dados vetoriais utilizados na plataforma Falo Chinês.">
  <section class="py-16 border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/10 border border-brand-gold/25 text-xs font-bold text-brand-gold tracking-widest uppercase">
          📜 LICENÇAS OPEN-SOURCE
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-black text-white tracking-tight mt-4">
          Conformidade Legal e Licenciamento
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Esta plataforma utiliza componentes de software livre e dados vetoriais licenciados. Abaixo estão os termos de uso e atribuição exigidos por cada licença.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Hanzi Writer License -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl border border-brand-jade/20 shrink-0">
              🖊️
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white">
                Aviso de Tecnologia e Licença Open-Source
              </h2>
              <div class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
                <p>
                  O módulo de animação e reconhecimento de escrita dos caracteres chineses integrado neste aplicativo/site é motorizado pela tecnologia open-source <strong class="text-brand-jade">Hanzi Writer</strong>, licenciado sob a <strong class="text-white">MIT License</strong>.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Copyright &copy; 2018 <a href="https://chanind.github.io/hanzi-writer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline">David Chanin</a>
                </p>
                <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-xl p-5 text-xs font-mono text-gray-400 leading-relaxed border border-white/5">
                  <p>Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to deal in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:</p>
                  <br/>
                  <p>The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.</p>
                  <br/>
                  <p>THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
                  Fonte: <a href="https://github.com/chanind/hanzi-writer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline">github.com/chanind/hanzi-writer</a>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Arphic License -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-8 border border-white/5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-purple/10 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl border border-brand-purple/20 shrink-0">
              📐
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white">
                Licenciamento de Dados Vetoriais (SVG)
              </h2>
              <div class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
                <p>
                  Os dados vetoriais de traços (SVG/JSON) para caracteres em Chinês Tradicional utilizados nesta plataforma são provenientes do projeto open-source <strong class="text-brand-purple">hanzi-writer-data-tw</strong>, distribuídos sob a <strong class="text-white">Arphic Public License</strong>.
                </p>
                <p>
                  O uso comercial e a redistribuição desses dados estão plenamente autorizados e em conformidade legal, conforme os termos da licença Arphic.
                </p>
                <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-xl p-5 text-xs font-mono text-gray-400 leading-relaxed border border-white/5">
                  <p>Arphic Public License (ARPHIC)</p>
                  <br/>
                  <p>Copyright &copy; 1999 Arphic Technology Co., Ltd.</p>
                  <br/>
                  <p>Permission is hereby granted to use, copy, modify, distribute, and sublicense the accompanying fonts and data, with or without modification, for any purpose, provided that the following conditions are met:</p>
                  <br/>
                  <p>1. All copies of the fonts and data, including any modifications thereof, must retain the above copyright notice, this license notice, and the disclaimer below.</p>
                  <p>2. The name of Arphic Technology Co., Ltd. may not be used to endorse or promote products derived from this software without specific prior written permission.</p>
                  <br/>
                  <p>THE FONTS AND DATA ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
                  Fonte: <a href="https://github.com/parsimony/hanzi-writer-data-tw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline">github.com/parsimony/hanzi-writer-data-tw</a>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Summary -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-jade/5 to-brand-purple/5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <span class="text-2xl">🛡️</span>
            <p>
              Todos os componentes técnicos operam em total conformidade com as diretrizes comerciais de distribuição global.
              Para dúvidas sobre licenciamento, entre em contato através dos nossos canais oficiais.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
